@startuml
title OmniDesk AI Sprint Workflow

start

:Review relevant milestone outcome;
:Refine Product Backlog as needed;
:Select Sprint backlog items;
:Define Sprint Goal;
:Confirm or define acceptance criteria;
:Break selected items into engineering tasks;
:Perform lifecycle work required by Sprint Goal;
note right
Requirements, Analysis, Design,
Implementation, Testing, or
Documentation as needed.
end note
:Run relevant automated and manual verification;
:Run applicable quality and security checks;

if (Sprint Goal and acceptance criteria satisfied?) then (yes)
  :Review Sprint Increment;
  :Record completed and incomplete work;
else (no)
  :Return incomplete work to the backlog;
  :Record discoveries and required follow-up;
endif

stop

note right
A Sprint produces a meaningful,
reviewable Increment.

A Sprint does not automatically
create a release.
end note

@enduml
